a travels to the Keyblade Graveyard determined to rescue Kairi and discovers truths that he never could have imagined.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552450/extras/60c929fa5ae3f2750e1102ac446db2bd.poster.avif?t=1726051317\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552450/extras/60c929fa5ae3f2750e1102ac446db2bd.webm?t=1726051317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552450/extras/60c929fa5ae3f2750e1102ac446db2bd.mp4?t=1726051317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
